        "eyebrow": "Product Overview",
        "title": "The sweet spot of the FLEX Series.",
        "text": "The Sensol FLEX is the sweet spot of the FLEX Series — a mid-range reformer that grows with you from your first tentative footwork to challenging full-body strength sessions. With 90 kg of maximum resistance powered by dual 1000W servo motors and 0.5 kg precision increments, the FLEX provides the progressive challenge that committed practitioners demand, without the premium price tag of studio-grade equipment."
      }
