        "eyebrow": "Key Feature 01",
        "title": "90 kg Resistance That Grows With You",
        "text_1": "The FLEX delivers up to 90 kg of servo motor-precise resistance — 50% more than the FLEX AIR's 60 kg capacity. This means the FLEX won't plateau as your strength improves. Whether you're a beginner building foundational stability or an intermediate practitioner pushing into advanced movements, the 0.5 kg increment adjustments let you progress at precisely the right pace.",
        "text_2": "The dual 1000W servo motors ensure smooth, consistent tension throughout every repetition, eliminating the jerky resistance curve of spring-based reformers. The Align-Pilates F3 ($1,999) offers comparable spring resistance but lacks precision increments, app connectivity, and dual-function capability. The FLEX delivers more features for $799 less."
      }
    },
