        "eyebrow": "Key Feature 02",
        "title": "Serious Versatility in a Single Machine",
        "text_1": "The FLEX isn't just a reformer — it's a complete training system that replaces multiple pieces of equipment. Use the footboard and carriage for Pilates, the short handles for rows, presses, and curls, the barbell bar for compound lifts, and the adjustable arms for targeted isolation work.",
        "text_2": "With 0–132° arm adjustment across 8 positions and three training modes, the FLEX supports over 200 distinct movements. This is the versatility of a fully equipped home gym in a single, elegant machine. To match the FLEX's versatility with traditional equipment, you'd need a reformer plus a cable machine, dumbbells, and a home gym setup totalling $5,000+."
      }
    },
