        "image_position": "left",
        "eyebrow": "Key Feature 03",
        "title": "Three Training Modes for Three Dimensions of Fitness",
        "text_1": "Standard Mode provides traditional progressive resistance for building strength and endurance. Off-centre Mode shifts the resistance vector, engaging stabiliser muscles and challenging your balance in ways that traditional reformers simply cannot. Constant Mode maintains consistent tension throughout the entire range of motion, maximising time-under-tension for muscle growth and endurance.",
        "text_2": "No other reformer on the Australian market offers multiple training modes — this is a Sensol exclusive. Traditional reformers offer one resistance profile. The FLEX's three modes effectively give you three different machines in one, each targeting different fitness adaptations."
      }
    },
